repo:objectstack#2 · os-steve · session_01ADHkmRXuRn93HphKp7kXEz

File surface amended (claim 6931312108, card thread `session_01ADHkmQC5YhoBASNPYbDXuQ`, branch `claude/project-thread-1aw09w`), on the building thread's measured read before its first push:

- added `packages/runtime/src/action-dispatch.ts`: the new exported seam sits beside `dispatchAction` and reuses its host-dispatcher registry (importing the HTTP dispatcher's value from `domains/mcp.ts` would make an import cycle);
- added `packages/runtime/src/http-dispatcher.ts`: one delegating method, the same shape as the existing host-action dispatch, placed through the same request placement;
- added `packages/runtime/src/action-confirmation-handoff-33690.test.ts`: the new pins go into this existing shared harness as a top-level `describe` (ruling record 6583487846); no existing case changes;
- added `content/docs/ui/actions.mdx`: one short subsection on resuming a handed-off run, under the existing dispatch section, so the new export is documented where its sibling is;
- `packages/runtime/src/action-invocation-audit.ts` is no longer expected to change (the host door reuses the existing invocation record).
